        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Canaropa JNF-FP228-120-630, Rectangular Satin Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 4-11/16 Inch Rectangular Satin Stainless Steel Flush Pull is made in Europe by JNF, a company who is known for their modern take on stainless steel hardware. The satin stainless steel finish of this rectangular flush pull enhances the modern look. For use as a cabinet pull, a pocket door handle, or a sliding barn door pull. Comes packaged with all the necessary hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<center><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/CAN-228-dimentions.gif?v=1704354735\" width=\"581\" height=\"109\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Canaropa JNF-228 Stainless Steel Flush Pull Dimensions\"></center>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Rectangular Pocket Door Pull with Satin Stainless Steel Finish:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 4-11/16\" (120 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-19/32\" (40 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 19/32\" (16 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 17-32\" (14 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Length: 3-1/2\" (89 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Opening Width: 1\" (25 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Cutout Opening Length: 3-3/8\" (85 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Cutout Opening Width: 7/8\" (23 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 2 each  #4 x 3/4\" Stainless Steel Installation Screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
